{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000199","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000199"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000199","label":"祭公謀父","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"祭公謀父","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0007"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p027","quote":"祭公謀父"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與敘事建立；同名與世襲官號不得全庫合併，本名未見不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0007"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:p027"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-004-zhou"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0007","start":7,"end":11,"surface":"祭公謀父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000199","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p027","text":"穆王將征犬戎，祭公謀父諫曰：「不可。先王燿德不觀兵。夫兵戢而時動，動則威，觀則玩，玩則無震。是故周文公之頌曰：『載戢干戈，載櫜弓矢，我求懿德，肆于時夏，允王保之。』先王之於民也，茂正其德而厚其性，阜其財求而利其器用，明利害之鄉，以文修之，使之務利而辟害，懷德而畏威，故能保世以滋大。昔我先王世后稷以服事虞、夏。及夏之衰也，棄稷不務，我先王不窋用失其官，而自竄於戎狄之閒。不敢怠業，時序其德，遵修其緒，修其訓典，朝夕恪勤，守以敦篤，奉以忠信。奕世載德，不忝前人。至于文王、武王，昭前之光明而加之以慈和，事神保民，無不欣喜。商王帝辛大惡于民，庶民不忍，訢載武王，以致戎于商牧。是故先王非務武也，勸恤民隱而除其害也。夫先王之制，邦內甸服，邦外侯服，侯衛賓服，夷蠻要服，戎翟荒服。甸服者祭，侯服者祀，賓服者享，要服者貢，荒服者王。日祭，月祀，時享，歲貢，終王。先王之順祀也，有不祭則修意，有不祀則修言，有不享則修文，有不貢則修名，有不王則修德，序成而有不至則修刑。於是有刑不祭，伐不祀，征不享，讓不貢，告不王。於是有刑罰之辟，有攻伐之兵，有征討之備，有威讓之命，有文告之辭。布令陳辭而有不至，則增修於德，無勤民於遠。是以近無不聽，遠無不服。今自大畢、伯士之終也，犬戎氏以其職來王，天子曰『予必以不享征之，且觀之兵』，無乃廢先王之訓，而王幾頓乎？吾聞犬戎樹敦，率舊德而守終純固，其有以御我矣。」王遂征之，得四白狼四白鹿以歸。自是荒服者不至。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000197","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0007","start":7,"end":11,"surface":"祭公謀父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000199","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"周文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000156","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同段明示人物與敘事暫定短稱，不作其他段落或其他時代的自動識別。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000160","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0232","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000139","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0235","start":235,"end":237,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m027-0260","start":260,"end":264,"surface":"